<title>ITALY: Fiumicino airport appoints cargo services manager.</title>
<headline>Fiumicino airport appoints cargo services manager.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rome Fiumicino Leonardo da Vinci airport managing company, Aeroporti di Roma, said Cesare Di Cecco had been appointed cargo services and operations manager.</p>
<p>Di Cecco started his career with Alitalia and later joined Milan-based airport managing company SEA as cargo director of that city's Linate airport.</p>
<p>He is also a member of the ICAA Freight Facilities Working Group.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
